# IVD Framework — Cursor Rules
# Development rules for working on the IVD framework itself.
# Both blocks below also serve as the canonical example of what
# users should install in their own projects when adopting IVD.

# <BEGIN-IVD v1.11>
# ==============================================================================
# Source: leocelis/ivd/recipes/agent-rules-ivd.yaml v1.11
